WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.945 --> 00:00:04.205
Hi, I'm Dr. Craig Anderson.

2
00:00:04.885 --> 00:00:06.525
I get a lot of questions around here.

3
00:00:07.365 --> 00:00:11.245
Probably the most popular one is what's a root canal?

4
00:00:11.825 --> 00:00:13.165
So what a root canal is,

5
00:00:14.145 --> 00:00:16.525
if you take a horizontal cross section through the tooth,

6
00:00:17.265 --> 00:00:20.365
the center is hollow like a pipe,

7
00:00:21.225 --> 00:00:22.765
and I go down the center of that pipe.

8
00:00:22.885 --> 00:00:26.005
I clean out the length of the pipe, the width of the pipe,

9
00:00:26.605 --> 00:00:29.085
I dry the center, and then I cement

10
00:00:29.085 --> 00:00:30.165
the final filling material.

11
00:00:30.425 --> 00:00:32.925
It is a rubber inert called gunna percha,

12
00:00:33.305 --> 00:00:35.965
and then the permanent restoration ultimately gets placed

13
00:00:36.465 --> 00:00:40.885
either a permanent filling or a crown.

14
00:00:41.385 --> 00:00:43.045
It depends on the set of circumstances

15
00:00:43.155 --> 00:00:44.445
that your tooth thick dictates.

16
00:00:45.225 --> 00:00:48.205
And so there you go. That's what a root canal is.
